<title>USA: Public Service New Mexico Q4 shr higher.</title>
<headline>Public Service New Mexico Q4 shr higher.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.30		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net		 12,700		   5,000</p>
<p> Oper revs	 NA			 NA</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.72		    $1.72</p>
<p> Net		 72,600		   75,600</p>
<p> Oper revs	 883,400		  808,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Public Service Co of New Mexico.</p>
<p>1996 earnings reduced by a net of $7.1 million pre-tax or $0.10 a share from one-time adjustments. 1995 figures up by a net of $25.1 million pre-tax or $0.37 a share from non-recurring items.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 earnings reduced by a net of $10.5 million pre-tax or $0.15 a share in one-time items. 1995 earnings down by a net of $0.12 a share in one-time items.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
